{
  "about": "הקרמיקה של נועה, a fictional free Wix site under a path (noa-example.wixsite.com/shop): every page, sitemap and product page hangs from /shop, the host's root is a 404, and the same host has another site (/other-site) that is not this store's. Shapes as in examples/wix-store; the FAQ page has its questions in FAQPage JSON-LD only, and the logo is an SVG with the store's one colour.",
  "host": "noa-example.wixsite.com",
